# 减小构建上下文（Docker 18.09 的经典构建器会全量传输上下文）
.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
train
speechscore
asset
clearvoice/samples
deployment/logs
deployment/tmp
**/*.onnx
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
*.md

# 导出的镜像 tar 包等离线交付产物：绝不能进构建上下文（动辄几 GB）
offline-artifacts
deployment/offline-artifacts
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
